  triage:description "quality-mgr QA-1 (req-qa), PR #1402 @ c13f9bddf, https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1402#issuecomment-5643113496. Acceptance criterion 3's literal grep pattern (select_open_task) substring-matches BA.2's legitimate select_open_tasks_for_member/select_open_tasks_for_team (4 occurrences, 3 files). Intent satisfied, letter of AC3 not; the criterion's wording needs anchoring (\\bselect_open_task\\b or similar) so future mechanical re-checks are accurate. fenix's ruling (https://github.com/randlee/atm-core/pull/1402#issuecomment-5643134050): STANDS, minor -- anchor AC3's pattern in the sprint doc (one-line edit). Folded into BA3-FIX-R3-1789183410." ;
